{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first four terms of an arithmetic sequence are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e29f2bdaed9426f0cd48c4ded26d76653197a350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, x, b, 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"16\" />. The ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/286f2d4fac693ce1629ae2f83aa2ff05d851011e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{4} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{3} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"364\" height=\"37\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To get from the second term to the fourth term, we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> lots of the common difference, so if the common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d3ac5df615a5e3d5ca97aca5ef4aaaea043cf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d = 2x -x = x \\implies d = \\frac{x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"225\" height=\"33\" />. Thus the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/f/b9fc7b7865bd111303e7a950cfab9ffc6e8901ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{2}, x, \\frac{3x}{2}, 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" />, so the ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/41382fb5a4f9c381a328983eeace2dc22fc0bb3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{x}{2}}{\\frac{3x}{2}} = \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"58\" height=\"44\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/d/f0d5b8fdfd2bd98c8be0bad569663660c33f3438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHS